values ('d0e1f2a3-4b5c-4e04-9b34-4f5a6b7c8d44', 'theory-of-architecture', 'Theory of Architecture', 'Theory of Architecture is an advanced seminar in architectural discourse, criticism, and design thought. Students read foundational and contemporary texts alongside buildings, cities, drawings, exhibitions, and media. The course develops the ability to interpret architecture as cultural argument, political practice, sensory experience, technical imagination, historical construction, and public responsibility.');

